=== BALAY & BEYOND — PROJECT SUMMARY ===
Everything from your Home. and More. Demo-ready. Deploys to Render after demo.
Operated by 1-2 non-technical admins post-handoff.


--- TECH STACK ---

Backend:    Django 5.x, Python, Django ORM, Django sessions, Django built-in auth
Database:   SQLite3 locally (offline/demo) → PostgreSQL on Render via dj-database-url
Frontend:   Vanilla HTML, CSS, JavaScript — no frameworks, no build step
Styling:    Tailwind CSS via CDN (zero config), Lucide icons via CDN
Payments:   Mock only — always succeeds, 1.5s fake delay, no real gateway
Static:     Whitenoise (Django serves its own static files on Render)
Deployment: Render (gunicorn + build.sh + render.yaml)
Run local:  python manage.py runserver


