--- MOCK PAYMENT FLOW ---

1. User fills checkout form (contact, shipping, fake card fields)
2. "Place Order" click → client-side validation → full-screen spinner overlay
3. After 1500ms JS timeout → POST to /payments/process/
4. payments/views.py:
     - Validates CheckoutForm server-side
     - Maps shipping method key to server-side SHIPPING_RATES dict
       (never trusts client-posted price)
     - Creates Order + OrderItems, status = confirmed
     - Clears cart session
     - Redirects to /orders/<id>/
5. Confirmation shows: order number, itemized summary, subtotal
   (total - shipping_cost), shipping cost, total, estimated 3-5 days

Fake card fields: card number, expiry, CVV, name on card.
Never sent to backend. Purely cosmetic. No Luhn validation.

SHIPPING_RATES (server-side only):
  standard: ₱0.00    (3-5 business days)
  express:  ₱150.00  (1-2 business days)
  sameday:  ₱300.00  (Metro only)


--- RENDER DEPLOYMENT ---

Required ENV vars:
  SECRET_KEY      → generate fresh value (not dev key)
  DEBUG           → False
  ALLOWED_HOSTS   → your-app.onrender.com
  DATABASE_URL    → set only when upgrading to PostgreSQL

settings.py pattern:
  DATABASES = { 'default': dj_database_url.config(default='sqlite:///db.sqlite3') }
  ALLOWED_HOSTS = os.environ.get('ALLOWED_HOSTS', 'localhost').split(',')
  MIDDLEWARE includes WhiteNoiseMiddleware after SecurityMiddleware
  STATIC_ROOT = BASE_DIR / 'staticfiles'

build.sh:
  #!/usr/bin/env bash
  set -o errexit
  pip install -r requirements.txt
  python manage.py collectstatic --no-input
  python manage.py migrate
  python manage.py seed_demo

render.yaml:
  type: web, runtime: python
  buildCommand: ./build.sh
  startCommand: gunicorn config.wsgi:application

requirements.txt must include:
  Django>=5.0, gunicorn, whitenoise, dj-database-url,
  psycopg2-binary, python-dotenv

Pre-deploy checklist:
  [ ] DEBUG=False in Render ENV
  [ ] SECRET_KEY is fresh
  [ ] build.sh is executable (chmod +x build.sh)
  [ ] collectstatic runs clean locally
  [ ] seed_demo uses get_or_create throughout
  [ ] products.json is committed (not gitignored)
  [ ] ALLOWED_HOSTS includes .onrender.com domain
  [ ] render.yaml committed to repo root


